  "chassis": {
   "confidence": "datasheet",
   "note": "datasheet - 4U, 7.0 in (177.8 mm) high, 19.0 in wide and 7.22 in (183.4 mm) deep. The width is the 482.6 of 19 in, ears included, as a rack-face part is its ears and what hangs off them. The depth is the maker's overall projection from the rail face, cover and fingers included, and not a body depth. The data sheet's Mount Type is \"Rack Mount 19\" Horizontal\", and its Product Description adds \", 4RU\"."
